From 5e865d9eff779d8cc4ff0566615313f2e02d5697 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 08:36:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] ci-flaky-cards: only persistent unavailability turns
 the cron red

Superseded cancelled runs are not_applicable; carried-over jobs of a
re-run attempt are read from the attempt that ran them; a fresh missing
artifact retries; unreadable data exits 1 only after two consecutive
polls past a 15 min grace window (bounded state).
